<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Halla wins $213 mln shipbuilding order.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Halla wins $213 mln shipbuilding order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Halla Engineering and Heavy Co, an affiliate of the Halla Group, said on Monday it has won $213 million worth of shipbuilding orders from Vroon B.V. of the Netherlands.  </p>
<p>Halla will build six 45,000 deadweight tonne chemical tankers for delivery from the beginning of 1999, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Halla has won a total of $663 million shipbuilding orders so far this year for 18 vessels.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
